{"script":"sub_0_11_2","des":"挖掘结晶","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]你是说，你想要蛇腹矿坑里那些闪得晶晶亮亮的石头矿是吗……？[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]这个嘛，我倒是不太明白。那种矿石并非金属，[r]质地软得完全没法加工在装备上，这石头你们要咋用？[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]呃……这和你说不太明白啦。就是那个——嗯……%主人公有一个神秘的方法，[r][l]这样、那样，然后最后这样，就可以让我们的伙伴变强！总之就是这样！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]啊……？你要不要听听看你在说什么？[r][l]……你怎么说，工匠？[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]哦……哦。原来里面有着魔物变得暴躁的线索啊。[r][l]也就是说，和咱们之前收集的史莱姆核心差不多喽。[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]对对，就那么回事儿！你们觉得是废物，只有我们能好好利用它！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]那你这么一说，我可就不太想白白让给你们了，哈哈哈。[r][l]咱们中央工房也不是救济院，多少得给我们再干点活吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1","y":20,"d":0.8,"x":0},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]唉你这大叔——！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]嘿，我这对荒野客可算是客气的了。既然这石头有你说的这么玄乎，[r]你就再下次矿井，为我们清理些魔物当作交换吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]顺便，我对你们刚才说的那个神秘的方法挺感兴趣。[r][l]火、水、地、风……你把这四种结晶都各带些回来，就权当给我开开眼界吧。怎么样？[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]啊，[wait=300]这倒是好办。毕竟那种结晶也只有矿坑里有，清理一些魔物也是自然的。[r][l]怎么样，%主人公？准备好以后我们就出发吧！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}